          "description": "<p><b>SMHI WMS service</b></p>\
         <p>Water Bodies</p>\
         Sweden's surface water bodies under the EU Water Framework Directive (Vattendirektivet), subject to environmental quality standards. Based on SVAR 2022:1.2, with four layers (established or preliminary): rivers, lakes, coastal waters, and offshore waters.",
