        {
          "name": "Vattendelare",
          "type": "wfs-group",
          "url": "https://opendata-view.smhi.se/SMHI_vatten_RiverBasin/HY.PhysicalWaters.Catchments/wfs?service=wfs&request=getcapabilities",
          "description": "<p><b>SMHI WFS service</b></p>\
         <p>Vattendelare</p>\
         A main river basin demarcates the area draining into an outlet point into the sea. Within a collaboration between Lantmäteriet and SMHI,\
         hydrographic map products have been produced during the period 2013 - 2017, so that in March 2018 there was data for all of Sweden.",
          "info": [
