          "url": "https://geodata.havochvatten.se/geoservices/riksintresse-for-yrkesfiske/ows",
          "description": "<p><b>Havs- och vattenmyndigheten WMS service</b></p>\
            <p>Riksintresse för yrkesfiske</p>\
            Areas of national interest for commercial fishing are designated in marine areas, lakes and streams as well as for fishing ports.\
            The Swedish Agency for Marine and Water Management provides information on areas that are of national interest for commercial fishing in accordance with the Environmental Code's provisions on national interest.\
            <br>The areas listed as of national interest for commercial fishing together meet these criteria: \
            <p>1. The area is home to values of great national importance<br>\
            2. the area is needed to fulfil Sweden's international commitments, or<br>\
            3. The area is needed to implement or maintain nationally important structures</p>",
