      "name": "Naturvårdsverket NMD",
      "type": "wms-group",
      "url": "https://geodata.naturvardsverket.se/inspire/lc-nmd/ows?SERVICE=WMS&",
      "description": "<p><b><p>Naturvårdsverket WMS service</b></p> \
      National Land Cover Data/Nationella marktäckedata (NMD) is a comprehensive mapping of Sweden. The aim is to obtain basic information about the landscape and how it is changing. \
      The mapping was carried out from 2017 to February 2019 and thereafter the data is planned to be updated every 5 years. NMD consists of a base mapping in 25 thematic classes in three hierarchical levels. \
      The mapping is in raster format with a resolution of 10 meters and a minimum mapping unit down to 0.01 hectares.",
      "info": [
        {
          "name": "More information",
          "content": "<p><a href='https://www.naturvardsverket.se/verktyg-och-tjanster/kartor-och-karttjanster/nationella-marktackedata?_t_hit.id=Boilerplate_Episerver_Features_EpiserverFind_Models_EpiserverFindDocument/8461_sv&_t_q=nmd&_t_id=-qZAOkOpSEaROdi1oE6D6g&_t_tags=siteid:69c7ea6e-2b02-4832-8c8c-31da973f12f1,language:sv'>Naturvårdsverket - Nationella Marktäckedata</a></p>"
